             * 3d      | RETURNDATASIZE | 0 cds 0 0 0 0          |                       |
             * 3d      | RETURNDATASIZE | 0 0 cds 0 0 0 0        |                       |
             * 37      | CALLDATACOPY   | 0 0 0 0                | [0..cds): calldata    |
             *                                                                           |
