             * 3d      | RETURNDATASIZE | rds rds success 0 0    | [0..cds): calldata    |
             * 93      | SWAP4          | 0 rds success 0 rds    | [0..cds): calldata    |
             * 80      | DUP1           | 0 0 rds success 0 rds  | [0..cds): calldata    |
             * 3e      | RETURNDATACOPY | success 0 rds          | [0..rds): returndata  |
             *                                                                           |
